Mom: Cleaning up?
No worries. I'll take care of it later.{VAR BE01}
Shouldn't you be on your way to
meet Professor Juniper?{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Yes, thank you!
Please excuse us.{VAR BE01}
Come on.
Let's go thank Professor Juniper.{VAR BE01}

Mom: My, my, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Pokémon battles are so lively,
aren't they?{VAR BE01}
I could hear the Pokémon's
cries clear down here!{VAR BE01}

Your Pokémon is looking great!{VAR BE01}
Now, if you're going out,
don't forget your “cross-transceiver"!{VAR BE01}

You're going to thank the
professor too, right?{VAR BE00}
Better get going, honey!

Mom: Phew! I'm taking a little break
from cleaning up.{VAR BE01}
You and your Pokémon should take
a break, too.{VAR BE01}
Good Trainers don't push their
Pokémon too hard.{VAR BE01}

Mom: You and your Pokémon should all be
filled with energy again!{VAR BE00}
Now, you can go anywhere!

Mom: {VAR 0100 0000}!
How are your Pokémon?{VAR BE01}
You should rest a little!{VAR BE01}
Good Trainers don't push
their Pokémon too hard.{VAR BE01}

Mom: Great! You and your Pokémon
look raring to go, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Best get back to your journey!

Mom: {VAR 0100 0000},
are you being kind to your Pokémon?{VAR BE01}
Pokémon work so hard to help you out!{VAR BE01}
You're normally very kind to your
Pokémon, aren't you?

Mom: Now that you mention it...{VAR BE01}
Your father went on a journey
with Pokémon, just as you are!{VAR BE01}
We met during his trip...

Mom: How are things going?{VAR BE01}
Have you caught many Pokémon?
That was the professor's request, right?

Mom: I wonder what Cheren and Bianca
will find during their travels.{VAR BE01}
What they really want from life...{VAR BE01}
If they figure that out for themselves,
I think their journeys will prove to be{VAR BE00}
all they could hope for!

Mom: {VAR 0100 0000}!
Welcome home!{VAR BE01}
Sounds like you've been through a lot!
You should rest a little bit!{VAR BE01}

Mom: Oh, my!
You and your Pokémon look full of bounce!{VAR BE01}
This is just a little advice from your
mother, but...{VAR BE01}
When a Pokémon's energy--um, I mean,
HP--runs out, hurry to a Pokémon Center{VAR BE00}
and get it restored.{VAR BE01}
It's also a good idea to buy Potions
at a Pokémon Mart for times when you're{VAR BE00}
adventuring far from civilization.{VAR BE01}
Please be careful!
Have a good trip!{VAR BE00}
I'll always be cheering for you!

“Mom": Welcome home, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Seems like you've been through
many amazing things, is it not so?{VAR BE01}

“Mom": Incredible, really.{VAR BE01}
Amazing, absolutely, meeting these
two Pokémon of legend!{VAR BE01}

“Mom": Oh!
I still wear my disguise! Pardon!{VAR BE01}
Or, rather, let me introduce myself.{VAR BE01}

I am a globe-trotting elite of the
International Police.{VAR BE01}
My name... Ah, no, I shall inform you
of my code name only.{VAR BE01}
My code name, it is Looker.
It is how I am called!{VAR BE01}

Looker: Behind the scenes in this region
of Unova, an organization called{VAR BE00}
Team Plasma conspires...{VAR BE01}
This I have heard, and therefore,
to this region I must come, but...{VAR BE01}

Thanks to the Gym Leaders and to you,
yes, Team Plasma's castle has fallen.{VAR BE01}
And the members, they have gone upon
their separate ways!{VAR BE00}
This is what I hear, most certainly!{VAR BE01}

But, however!
However, but...{VAR BE01}
The ones known as the Seven Sages--still,
they hide themselves in the Unova region.{VAR BE01}

And so, in the end, it explains why I must
ask this of you, Trainer of amazing skill!{VAR BE01}
Travel the Unova region and search it up
and search it down for the Seven Sages!{VAR BE01}
Alder, the Champion of renown,
recommended you to my notice.{VAR BE01}
Are you willing to help me?

Ah, ah!{VAR BE01}
Yet once more shall I ask!{VAR BE01}
If you please, travel the Unova region
and search it low and high for these{VAR BE00}
Seven Sages!

Looker: Excellent! I thank you!{VAR BE01}
Now I feel as if I have perhaps 
a million people on my side.{VAR BE01}
Permit me to give this into your hands!{VAR BE01}

Mom: Weren't we talking about
Team Plasma's Seven Sages?{VAR BE01}
What does this have to do with
looking for those people?{VAR BE01}

Looker: I see.{VAR BE01}
It is truly {VAR 0100 0000}'s mama to ask so!
What a magnificent question! I admire it.{VAR BE01}
It is my pleasure to answer.{VAR BE01}
Absolutely nothing!{VAR BE01}

Looker: Yes, I shall provide the
explanation of this, the Super Rod!{VAR BE01}
First!
Face the water and employ the rod!{VAR BE01}
Second!
Concentrate your focal point!{VAR BE01}
When it occurs that these Pokémon bite,
“!" will indicate. Immediately, reel in!{VAR BE01}
For the rest, {VAR 0100 0000},
I depend upon you!{VAR BE01}

Mom: People from the International
Police are kind of...unique, aren't they?{VAR BE01}
Well, no worries. I think you should just
do what you want to do.{VAR BE01}
You're practically a grown-up now!
